walker antcolonies:monitor -4.5 -58 0.5 -90 OwnSize:1.0f,HungryIn:99999,SunIn:99999
follow 0 3.5 -6 0 25
cmd tick unfreeze
record on 3
go 8 -61 0 0.8
wait 60
shot p00
wait 60
shot p01
wait 60
shot p02
wait 60
shot p03
wait 60
shot p04
wait 60
shot p05
wait 60
shot p06
wait 60
shot p07
wait 60
shot p08
wait 55
shot p09
record off
